<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-08T14:24:39.936Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 14:24:39 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Somalia's Supreme Court declared President Hassan Sheikh Mohamud's term extension unlawful and the court chief reported threats to his life as armed forces seized the court. Al-Shabaab militants attacked a police station and camp in Garissa, while the Somali government warned that Houthi support could boost al-Shabaab's attack capabilities. The Somali police deputy chief warned of a security vacuum as Ugandan troops withdraw from the country. US forces have vacated the Baledogle airfield after more than a decade of use. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1SVFpORU5zQkRLVkp2OWNJWGplQWhXeFE5NkN4UXpOSGtzaVZNUzBfRXZ5cUxKMDliWGZ6a2I3bVMyRko4MlphZmpPdXgyVnRRcHlwdF96ZmxLems?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNR1dCZHpfSFFmWXNtMTc5a1dITXJZdEpyZjJyWHJRT1Q5MTNDX2ktaHNNYUNldHpsX1JabHB2dE5VZE82MHhYQzU3Wm1CU0N1NzlHWU0xLVhPTDA5bjMtS0M5cnFSVEZQc2ZkajVrT2RSMlYwSW5EWGtlTFhjN3BJNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Atlantic&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE9tQnBNRUdRZDdndXRhb1NGa0hIT2dSTEk2WTZCTHJCclBsYzF2YnBGUWpSNFVqaGdteEk3ZWVxVExmcTAxWl80QjNuSzBLZTluQjFndFc5R0VlZnVSOGFEQ0VvR21NcVhnM3RvRFdnME50c3RDOERjVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;kulu-media.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQOWVfd29MU3VTNlhqZTNVZFZOc1VUNlFVOGlzWkRBaFg2RjhmVTZiWVlaOWJURnlRWWp1MzBtVDUteWlvQ01vcFZlWXVhUHhzZm9CSUhSbHZNdHhacmtPUVBNTGFYQUZaUmc5eWIxeFFXbHh4RVZGeVEwRjdxNDYyR25tTmItTC1uVGtqbk5rdVpNcEZTRXBNMl84WQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Shabelle Media Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nilepost&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://